      <bpmn:userTask id="W4876_Task5" name="Define the enhanced-vetting package for executives/sensitive roles: full…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Define the enhanced-vetting package for executives/sensitive roles: full NBI/court, multi-source media/reputational, sanctions/PEP/litigation (links to VS-86/VS-100), conflicts-of-interest (links to VS-119/W426), credit-for-finance, reference interviews, education/employment verification, and (for security/CIT) enhanced criminal; lawful under RA 10173 with senior consent
Responsible (R): Screening Program Manager / Corporate Security / Legal / DPO
Accountable (A): CHRO / VP Legal &amp; Compliance / Board
