        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Execute via specialized vetting firm/external counsel (where appropriate): conduct the enhanced package for board-appointed executives and sensitive roles, with strict confidentiality (VS-159), and route findings to the Adverse-Action Board (W4871) and nominating/governance committee (VS-36)
Responsible (R): Corporate Security / External Vetting Firm / Legal
Accountable (A): CHRO / Board Nominating
