        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Maintain the re-screening schedule (role-tier-based periodicity) and the continuous-monitoring feed (sanctions/PEP watchlist links to VS-86, criminal/court monitoring where lawful, media/reputational for sensitive roles); reconcile to the workforce roster (VS-29)
Responsible (R): Screening Program Manager / Security / HR
Accountable (A): CHRO / VP Legal &amp; Compliance
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
