      <bpmn:userTask id="W4877_Task5" name="Manage triggered re-vet: on a triggering event (an arrest/conviction, a…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Manage triggered re-vet: on a triggering event (an arrest/conviction, a sanctions listing, an LP/fraud event VS-23/VS-125, a role change to higher-risk, a complaint), re-screen the individual with consent (W4868) and route findings to the Adverse-Action Board (W4871/W4880)
Responsible (R): Screening Program Manager / Security / Legal
Accountable (A): CHRO / VP Legal &amp; Compliance
Duration: Per event</bpmn:documentation>
