        <bpmn:outgoing>W4877_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4877_Task6" name="Decide &amp; act: clear (no action), enhanced-monitor, restrict duties, or separate…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Decide &amp; act: clear (no action), enhanced-monitor, restrict duties, or separate (W4880) per the individualized assessment and due process; document in the chain-of-custody (W4870) and feed re-screening outcomes to insider-risk (VS-23/VS-159) and analytics (W4881)
Responsible (R): Screening Program Manager / HR / Security / Labor Relations
Accountable (A): CHRO / VP Legal &amp; Compliance
Duration: Per event</bpmn:documentation>
