      <bpmn:userTask id="W4878_Task5" name="Maintain cross-entity consistency: the screening policy (W4866) and packages…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Maintain cross-entity consistency: the screening policy (W4866) and packages (W4869) apply uniformly across the 5 entities (Depot, Logistics, Digital Commerce, Property Mgmt, Holdings) and regions, with documented regional variations only where lawful/source-different (e.g., regional court-records availability)
Responsible (R): Screening Program Manager / HR Shared Services / Legal
