    <bpmn:process id="W_W4880" name="W4880. Adverse-Action Decisioning, Disqualification Handling &amp; NLRC/Due-Process" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Adverse screening finding (employee/contingent/vendor/executive); dispute/appeal; NLRC complaint
Frequency: Per adverse finding
Volume: ~80–150 adverse findings/year (subset of screens)
Owner: Adverse-Action Review Board (W4871) / Legal (VS-100.3) / Labor Relations (VS-84)
Participants: HR, Screening Program Manager, Security (VS-159), DPO (VS-91)
Source: workflow W4880 — Adverse-Action Decisioning, Disqualification Handling &amp; NLRC/Due-Process</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4880_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4880_Lane1" name="Review Board">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4880_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4880_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4880_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W4880_Lane2" name="Legal">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4880_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4880_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4880_Start4" name="Adverse screening finding (employee/contingent/vendor/executive); dispute/appeal; NLRC…">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4880_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4880_Task5" name="On an adverse finding, conduct the individualized assessment (W4866 —…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: On an adverse finding, conduct the individualized assessment (W4866 — nature/gravity/time-since/relevance-to-role/rehabilitation), issue the pre-adverse-action notice, allow the individual to respond/dispute/evidence rehabilitation, and verify the finding&#x27;s accuracy (W4883 false-document risk)
Responsible (R): Review Board / Legal / Screening Program Manager
Accountable (A): CHRO / VP Legal &amp; Compliance
Duration: Per finding</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4880_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4880_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4880_Task6" name="Decide: clear (no action), conditional (enhanced monitoring/restrictions), or…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Decide: clear (no action), conditional (enhanced monitoring/restrictions), or disqualify (withdraw offer / restrict duties / separate); document the decision and notice with due-process alignment (VS-84 NLRC); for separations, coordinate with VS-19 separation and VS-84 labor relations
Responsible (R): Review Board / HR / Labor Relations / Legal
Accountable (A): CHRO / VP Legal &amp; Compliance
Duration: Per finding</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4880_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4880_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4880_Task7" name="Manage appeals &amp; NLRC complaints (VS-84): the appeal path, evidence…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Manage appeals &amp; NLRC complaints (VS-84): the appeal path, evidence preservation (W4872), and labor-case defense; track adverse-action outcomes and bias indicators (W4871) to governance (W4888) and analytics (W4881)
Responsible (R): Legal / Labor Relations / Review Board
Accountable (A): CHRO / VP Legal &amp; Compliance
Duration: Per appeal</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4880_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4880_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4880_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4880_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4880_Annotation9">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-732 (ensure controlled execution — Vetting Operations Across Workforce Categories (PA-167.2).) | - CTL-732: individualized assessment; pre-adverse-action notice; due process; bias monitored
Owner: Adverse-Action Review Board (W4871) / Legal (VS-100.3) / Labor Relations (VS-84)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
